# SHA-1 of the certificate releases are signed with. Installed copies only accept an update
# signed by this exact certificate (UpdateChecker.verifySignature), so changing it locks out
# every existing user from automatic updates. bundle.sh signs with it when it is in the keychain;
# release.sh refuses to publish without it.
#   0.1.0 – 0.5.0   44863F50164CEA764278EA07686D5B349E8B0D94  "Transcriber Dev", created 2026-09-07
#   0.6.0 – 0.6.1   1D5941A49F518C486983DD9B946265409D915F76  "Transcriber Dev", re-created 2026-10-11
#                   after the original vanished from the keychain (0.5.0 users cannot update to these)
1D5941A49F518C486983DD9B946265409D915F76
